## MCP - Image OCR

**Endpoint:** POST /webhook/image-ocr

**Input (RFC-014):**
```json
{
  "context": {
    "image_url": "https://...",
    "file_type": "jpg",
    "project_id": "...",
    "guild_id": "...",
    "user_id": "..."
  },
  "plugin_context": {
    "api_keys": { "mistral": "..." }
  }
}
```

**Async (RFC-040):**
```json
{
  "context": { ... },
  "callback_url": "https://...",
  "job_id": "optional-uuid"
}
```

**Response (sync):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": { "text": "...", "pages": [...] },
  "meta": { "provider": "mistral" }
}
```

**Response (async 202):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "job_id": "uuid",
  "status": "processing"
}
```

**Analyzable:**
```json
{
  "accepts_image": true,
  "accepts_media": false,
  "output_fields": ["text", "confidence"],
  "domain": "documents"
}
```

